      "function_name": "connectorResearch",
      "description": "Two actions available:\n\n1. Search for businesses near a location:\n   {\"action\": \"search_places\", \"query\": \"daycare preschool\", \"location\": \"Worthington OH\", \"max_results\": 5}\n   Returns: {places: [{name, address, website, phone, rating, review_count, reviews: [{text, rating}], hours}]}\n\n2. Scrape a website for people and info:\n   {\"action\": \"scrape_website\", \"website_url\": \"https://example.com\"}\n   Returns: {pages_scraped: number, content: [{url, text}]}\n   Automatically tries /about, /about-us, /our-team pages.\n\nUse search_places to find businesses, then scrape_website to dig into each one. Also use your built-in web_search to find people's names, social profiles, and news articles."
